" redis-┌─ Keys · Patterns ──────────────────────────── ? or esc closes ─┐       "
" Redis │Everywhere                                                      │(1%)   "
"  0   1│0-6            Switch view, 0 Connections to 6 Search           │       "
"┌─ Patt│?              Show or hide this key list                       │mory ─┐"
"│ PATTE│a              Add a connection                                 │CT    │"
"│   ses│:              Open the command line                            │      │"
"│ ▾ cac│b              Switch the database (once connected)             │      │"
"│     c│q ctrl-c       Quit                                             │      │"
"│     c│Patterns                                                        │      │"
"│ ▾ use│↑↓ j k         Move the selection                               │ng    │"
"│     u│PgUp PgDn      Move one page                                    │      │"
"│     u│Home End g G   Jump to the first or last row                    │ng    │"
"└──────│→ ← l h        Expand or collapse the selected group            │──────┘"
"┌─ cach│enter          Fold a group, or list a pattern's keys           │3.6G ─┐"
"│ SAMPL│/              Filter patterns by name                          │      │"
"│ cache│esc            Clear the filter, or show all nodes again        │      │"
"│ cache│o              Sort by memory, keys, avg size, no-TTL % or name │      │"
"│ cache│y              Copy the selected pattern to the clipboard       │      │"
"│ cache│Y              Copy a redis-cli --scan command for the pattern  │>30d  │"
"│ cache│r              Scan again, keeping old results meanwhile        │·     │"
"│ ▲ 1 o│s              Save a scan snapshot file                        │      │"
"│ $ red│x              Set a TTL on every key of the pattern            │      │"
"└──────│D              Delete every key of the pattern                  │──────┘"
" ↑↓ Mov└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ q Quit"
